# 🗣️ 8. Behavioral Interview Practice

## Question

**How do you prioritize multiple Help Desk tickets?**

### Professional Answer

> I prioritize tickets based on severity, urgency, business impact, number of users affected, security implications, and applicable SLAs. For example, an outage affecting an entire department or a security-related issue would generally take priority over a low-impact issue affecting one user. I would also communicate appropriately with affected users and keep the ticket documentation updated.

